Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I put one habit down, watched the dust settle slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought the storm had passed me, thought I was good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a different hunger started knocking at my door,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Same old ache in new clothes, like I'd met this ghost before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Different label, same flame,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Different road, same rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not broken, I am learning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How the pattern calls my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NTrigger to craving, back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Short relief, then the weight comes through,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not failing, I am seeing what is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NBut I can slow it, I can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One clear pause, one honest breath,\NAnd I choose a different step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress at midnight, loneliness at two,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Boredom in the morning finds a shortcut to undo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be food, could be scrolling, could be spending for a spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be work, could be nicotine, anything to dodge the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind learned survival\NFrom whatever eased the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I teach it something gentler,\NNot perfection - just a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NTrigger to craving, back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Short relief, then the weight comes through,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not failing, I am seeing what is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,\NBut I can slow it, I can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One clear pause, one honest breath,\NAnd I choose a different step.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.01,0:02:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Map the hour, map the feeling, map the places I get pulled,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Build a rhythm, build a refuge, make the empty moments full.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If withdrawal risk is rising, I reach for medical hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the deeper pattern work, I heal where it began.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypnotherapy for the pause, EFT to calm the wave,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Small repeats become a pathway, and that pathway starts to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the pattern, I know the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Trigger to craving doesn't own me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I meet it with awareness anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Steady progress over shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Same brain, new patterns, day by day,\NI am finding my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a perfect line, just honest ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Less escape, more life, more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What once was automatic can be relearned in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Same loop, new name - new ending, mine.
